0 NXT bumper bot (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: nxt-bumper-bot.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A MINDSTORMS NXT between two Technic beams 15 (two 3L pins through brick, beam and motor), two NXT
0 // motors behind it with their drive hubs at the rear (B left, C right) turning 88 mm wheels, two
0 // free 88 mm wheels on 3L axles turning in the beams, and an NXT touch sensor (input 1)
0 // held between the front of the beams by two axles: its button is the bumper. The front axles
0 // sit one hole above the motors' hubs, so the robot leans forward a little. Forward is LDraw +z.
